{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）上午11時29分，大圍圍方一間餐廳的職員報案，指其女同事的右手不慎卡在切肉機內無法拔出。消防員到場協助姓吳（58歲）女事主脫困，她手腕紅腫，經包紮後由救護車送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方相信她操作切肉機時，右手意外卡入機器，將案件列作「工業意外」，正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院時面露痛楚神情。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187381390023331840419805.jpeg/qeSI-AYGuau9WqhscIhxARu5vSqSciTiAN6m2QDeptk\"/><figcaption>傷者送院時面露痛楚神情。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大圍圍方。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231107/798701373930606592529461.jpeg/jJsZuq0v4A7iU7GkCtQymLdOeBWIU9mhC8m3WAvJt1g\"/><figcaption>大圍圍方。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.558143+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:35:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:18:02.655945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:04.065479+00:00","content_hash":"4e97bf9608b202e93f4a6d20a23154fbcf5d466fa232667fa30b18b48d62b207","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}